  tOpt('rapid_cut','rhythmic','连续快切转场（Rapid Cut）','连续快切转场（Rapid Cut）：通过多个短镜头快速切换，制造紧张感','Rapid Cut: rapid-fire succession of short cuts to heighten urgency','高频短促快切推进动作与紧迫感',0.1),
  tOpt('slow_dissolve','rhythmic','慢节奏叠化（Slow Dissolve）','慢节奏叠化（Slow Dissolve）：通过较长时间的叠化，营造抒情或梦幻氛围','Slow Dissolve: extended lingering cross-dissolve for lyrical or dreamlike mood','1.2秒长时慢节奏柔和叠化营造抒情时间流逝感',1.2),
  tOpt('smash_cut','rhythmic','冲击式切换（Smash Cut）','冲击式切换（Smash Cut）：从一个情绪或声音状态突然切换到强烈反差的画面','Smash Cut: jarring abrupt cut between starkly contrasting moods or states','在极静与极动/反差情绪之间突发冲击式硬切',0),
  tOpt('av_contrast_cut','rhythmic','声画反差转场（Audio-Visual Contrast Cut）','声画反差转场（Audio-Visual Contrast Cut）：利用声音与画面之间的反差制造戏剧效果','Audio-Visual Contrast Cut: cut using sharp contrast between sound and image for dramatic irony or shock','利用前镜声音与后镜画面的强烈反差完成戏剧性切换',0.2)
